    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n72149" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὀζώδης</span></b>  (A), <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ες</span>,
			(<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὄζος</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>having branches,</i> opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄοζος,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Thphr.
				<u>HP</u>
				1.5.4
			</span></i>, al. ; of a form of coral, <i><span class="en">
				Dsc.
				5.122
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>having knots in it,</i> of timber, <i><span class="en">
				Thphr.
				<u>HP</u>
				3.10.4
			</span></i> (
				Comp.
			), cf. <i><span class="en">
				Plin.
				<u>HN</u>
				16.65
			</span></i>.</div>
